# chaOS low-level

- Higher-half: stub VMA==LMA `0x10000`; rest via `boot/kernel.ld` at `0xC0010000+`.
- Page dirs must clone identity **and** high PDEs; destroy must skip both.
- Shell work off IRQ path (`shell_submit` / `shell_poll`, IF=1).
- ATA: single-sector PIO only.
- User ELFs at `USER_BASE` `0x40000000`; isolation supervisor-only kernel maps.
- Extend syscalls deliberately; sync `docs/agent/ABI.md` when it exists (P2.2).
